   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">KAWASAKI, Sept. 6, 2011  A model of the robotic cat named Doraemon is displayed at Fujiko F. Fujio Museum in Kawasaki of Japan, Sept. 6, 2011. The museum dedicated to Fujiko F. Fujio, the creator of the popular "Doraemon" cartoon series, opened from Sept. 3.  (/kenichiro Seki) (yh)</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
