   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">January 1, 2019, Urayasu, Japan - Disney characters Mickey and Minnie Mouse dressed in traditional kimono dresses, greet guests from a float during the theme park's annual New Year's Day parade at the Tokyo Disneyland in Urayasu, suburban Tokyo on Tuesday, January 1, 2019.   (Photo by Yoshio Tsunoda/AFLO) LWX -ytd-</rdf:li>
